Third-party software
--------------------
This repository contains no third-party source code. KiLoRA uses these packages at
run time. They are not included here and keep their own licenses:

  PyTorch        BSD-3-Clause
  safetensors    Apache-2.0
  NumPy          BSD-3-Clause
  Diffusers      Apache-2.0 (optional)
  PEFT           Apache-2.0 (development only)

The ComfyUI nodes run inside ComfyUI, which is a separate program under its own
license. This repository includes no ComfyUI code.

Base models
-----------
KiLoRA ships no base model weights. You download a base model yourself and must
follow its license and use terms.

  Z-Image (Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image), https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image
  License on the model card: Apache-2.0.

A mod trained on a base model is a derived set of weights. Check the base model's
terms before you share a mod.
